// A fifo named augogen is not the plate directory.
// The read ignores it and does not open it.
// The write replaces that fifo with a directory and does not open it.
// A waiting writer is not paired.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE augfifo ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law     ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG augfifo law

IMPULSE augfifo 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "augfifo" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
